WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.160 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 22=

01:55.480 --> 01:56.159
Sanniang,

01:56.680 --> 01:58.359
get a new set of clothes for Mr. Zhao.

01:59.079 --> 01:59.640
Sure.

02:05.680 --> 02:06.159
Let's go.

02:07.480 --> 02:07.920
Come on.

02:20.840 --> 02:21.840
Your father

02:22.759 --> 02:24.000
not only made me kneel,

02:24.400 --> 02:25.919
but also said I had no manners,

02:26.879 --> 02:28.039
and wasn't properly raised.

02:32.120 --> 02:32.960
You deserved it.

02:33.759 --> 02:34.919
Who told you to kneel?

02:35.479 --> 02:37.080
I am Xie Tingyun.

02:37.199 --> 02:38.039
I have nothing

02:38.039 --> 02:39.199
to do with the Fu family anymore.

02:39.360 --> 02:40.840
Why insist on claiming him
as your father-in-law?

02:40.840 --> 02:41.159
I...

02:49.280 --> 02:50.400
Stop pretending.

03:13.680 --> 03:14.639
I was wrong.

03:24.639 --> 03:26.280
I thought I was doing the right thing,

03:29.400 --> 03:30.719
but I upset you.

03:36.120 --> 03:37.159
The medicine is about to burn.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.160
I was wrong.

04:35.360 --> 04:37.240
You must tell me everything

04:38.959 --> 04:40.279
from now on.

04:46.600 --> 04:48.079
I don't want to grow distant from you.

04:48.279 --> 04:50.000
Neither do I.

04:54.079 --> 04:56.319
Actually, I don't want
to return to Ganlin alone.

04:59.199 --> 05:00.480
I want to take you

05:01.040 --> 05:02.240
with me.

05:04.800 --> 05:05.879
All this time

05:07.399 --> 05:08.639
in the capital,

05:09.319 --> 05:10.480
we've gained power

05:11.519 --> 05:12.839
and wealth.

05:13.759 --> 05:16.079
But you can barely have a peaceful meal.

05:17.720 --> 05:19.680
I just want you to live
a little lighter.

05:30.680 --> 05:31.879
Everyone says

05:32.879 --> 05:34.160
you are exceptionally brave,

05:34.879 --> 05:36.120
and that you have the power

05:36.240 --> 05:37.800
to stir up storms in the capital.

05:38.000 --> 05:38.920
But you

05:41.519 --> 05:43.040
don't want me caught in those storms.

05:54.920 --> 05:56.480
Once the salt reform begins,

05:57.959 --> 05:59.279
the political turmoil at court

05:59.680 --> 06:00.720
will only grow worse.

06:02.959 --> 06:04.160
But no matter how hard it gets,

06:04.879 --> 06:06.000
I will face it

06:07.199 --> 06:08.279
with you.

06:12.759 --> 06:13.879
I will help you.

06:44.040 --> 06:44.879
I know.

06:54.240 --> 06:55.040
Father.

06:55.120 --> 06:56.759
This empty plate is...

07:04.680 --> 07:06.439
This is an offering, Father.

07:07.000 --> 07:07.759
Besides,

07:07.759 --> 07:08.680
it has been rained on.

07:09.040 --> 07:10.800
Are you really going to eat that?

07:12.240 --> 07:13.120
What do you know?

07:13.600 --> 07:15.000
This is an offering
bestowed by the Emperor.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.240
Who are you to turn your nose up at it?

07:16.839 --> 07:17.600
Then

07:18.040 --> 07:19.959
I will go and prepare it with care.

07:45.439 --> 07:46.720
Someone!

07:46.920 --> 07:48.199
Fetch a healer!

07:49.040 --> 07:50.959
(Yu Residence)
I heard Commander Zhao

07:51.240 --> 07:52.759
stirred up quite a storm
at the Fu household.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.600
(Yu Residence)
You've arranged everything well.

07:56.160 --> 07:58.360
The Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor

07:59.040 --> 08:01.040
may only oversee one region for now.

08:02.000 --> 08:03.519
Once the pilot is completed,

08:05.319 --> 08:07.480
it will become a model
for the entire realm.

08:08.160 --> 08:09.519
When he returns to the capital

08:09.639 --> 08:11.040
to report his results,

08:11.639 --> 08:14.480
he will be the key figure
in overseeing the salt reform.

08:17.839 --> 08:19.680
Such a critical position

08:21.399 --> 08:23.160
must naturally be held
by one of our own.

08:24.279 --> 08:26.639
Jingxiu has been at the Hanlin Academy
for years.

08:26.839 --> 08:28.920
It is time for him
to take the next step.

08:30.040 --> 08:31.879
It can only be him.

08:33.080 --> 08:34.480
Tell him to get prepared.

08:34.480 --> 08:36.879
This opportunity must not be squandered.

08:38.879 --> 08:40.080
At court,

08:40.080 --> 08:42.399
I can put in a good word for him.

08:43.000 --> 08:45.279
But for matters beyond the court,

08:45.480 --> 08:47.279
I will rely entirely on you.

08:48.519 --> 08:49.440
Rest assured.

08:50.960 --> 08:52.840
Madam, your calligraphy
grows ever more refined.

08:56.960 --> 08:57.720
Mother.

08:58.399 --> 08:59.399
Is there something you need?

09:00.840 --> 09:02.200
I heard

09:03.480 --> 09:05.200
that the family intends
to have my husband

09:05.559 --> 09:07.679
compete for the post
of Imperial Salt Censor.

09:15.200 --> 09:17.000
You are well-informed.

09:18.080 --> 09:19.519
Madam Wei is close to me.

09:19.519 --> 09:21.399
Her husband is the Left Vice Minister
of the Ministry of Personnel.

09:21.480 --> 09:22.440
He can bypass Zhao Ling

09:22.440 --> 09:23.799
and submit the list directly upward.

09:24.039 --> 09:25.559
If you permit it, Mother,

09:25.759 --> 09:27.240
I would be willing to put in a word

09:27.879 --> 09:29.679
and ensure my husband's name is added.

09:35.080 --> 09:36.240
I know I am not the sharpest,

09:37.200 --> 09:38.279
but I only wish

09:38.879 --> 09:40.679
to do what little I can for the family.

09:40.799 --> 09:41.720
From now on,

09:42.519 --> 09:44.360
I hope you'll continue
to guide me, Mother.

09:49.279 --> 09:50.360
Very well.

09:50.720 --> 09:51.960
You may proceed.

09:55.240 --> 09:56.840
If you need silver, ask for silver.

09:57.000 --> 09:58.600
If you need to pull strings, tell me.

09:58.759 --> 09:59.600
But remember,

10:00.759 --> 10:01.799
this position

10:02.399 --> 10:03.720
is one I am determined to secure.

10:04.600 --> 10:05.679
I understand, Mother.

10:07.159 --> 10:07.799
Go.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.639
The Young Madam is still young.

10:17.639 --> 10:18.799
She was too eager

10:18.919 --> 10:20.120
and overstepped her bounds.

10:20.120 --> 10:21.320
When I was young,

10:22.759 --> 10:24.720
I never had to go to such lengths.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.600
Now,

10:27.039 --> 10:28.720
I must teach my son to strive,

10:29.080 --> 10:30.679
and my daughter-in-law to prove herself.

10:31.879 --> 10:33.240
I wonder which one of them

10:33.240 --> 10:34.399
will fail me.

10:36.279 --> 10:37.480
Call Jingxiu in.

10:38.039 --> 10:38.679
Yes.

10:49.240 --> 10:49.960
Madam,

10:50.159 --> 10:51.159
the Young Master is here.

10:54.559 --> 10:55.159
Mother.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.399
Your father has told you

11:03.399 --> 11:04.639
about the salt reform.

11:04.639 --> 11:06.399
Now is a critical time.

11:07.440 --> 11:09.279
The position of Imperial Salt Censor
is vacant.

11:09.600 --> 11:10.840
I have also asked Fan

11:10.840 --> 11:12.120
to make arrangements on your behalf.

11:15.000 --> 11:15.879
And you

11:20.080 --> 11:21.759
must turn your attention back.

11:23.440 --> 11:24.919
For a family like ours,

11:25.720 --> 11:26.799
the worst thing is to have

11:26.799 --> 11:28.120
scandal in the inner quarters.

11:37.519 --> 11:38.320
I understand, Mother.

11:39.279 --> 11:41.120
You have not returned to your room
to rest in days.

11:41.519 --> 11:43.720
Fan gave you a son.

11:45.159 --> 11:46.159
Do you know the pain

11:46.159 --> 11:47.559
a woman endures in childbirth?

11:47.960 --> 11:49.360
She gave everything

11:50.200 --> 11:51.960
for Ji.

11:55.840 --> 11:56.720
Rest assured, Mother.

11:58.120 --> 11:59.200
I will

12:00.399 --> 12:01.559
remember your kindness.

12:06.600 --> 12:07.279
You may go.

12:10.279 --> 12:11.039
I take my leave, Mother.

12:31.360 --> 12:32.000
Chengxin!

12:34.559 --> 12:35.799
Where are the magnolia paintings I did?

12:40.120 --> 12:40.879
In the past few days,

12:42.399 --> 12:44.000
has anyone come to my study?

12:44.919 --> 12:45.720
Madam

12:46.120 --> 12:47.759
and Ms. Shu did stop by.

12:48.159 --> 12:49.440
But they only stayed for a moment

12:49.639 --> 12:50.320
and left.

12:53.200 --> 12:55.159
Just as I thought.

12:58.279 --> 12:59.480
In this household,

13:00.080 --> 13:02.320
I'm nothing more than a clay Buddha
on a shrine.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.960
I have no seat in the front hall
when matters are discussed.

13:05.600 --> 13:07.399
They don't ask my opinion
on matters in the inner quarters either.

13:07.919 --> 13:09.000
Even my husband...

13:10.960 --> 13:11.960
I don't know how long it's been

13:11.960 --> 13:13.519
since he last set foot in my room.

13:15.720 --> 13:17.679
Since I volunteered for this assignment,

13:19.279 --> 13:20.480
I have to see it through.

13:21.600 --> 13:23.720
Otherwise, what place do I have
in this family?

13:32.440 --> 13:34.799
As much as I dislike Tian Wanyi,

13:41.279 --> 13:43.039
I still have to pay her a visit.

13:45.160 --> 13:47.360
(Wang Residence)

13:50.440 --> 13:51.320
Look at Sen.

13:55.440 --> 13:56.399
Sen,

13:56.799 --> 13:58.120
this robe you're wearing

13:58.120 --> 13:59.200
is new.

14:00.440 --> 14:02.320
And your hair tie is new too.

14:03.080 --> 14:04.799
If we wait much longer,

14:04.960 --> 14:05.919
you'll probably

14:06.240 --> 14:08.600
end up sworn brothers
with that stone lion.

14:10.039 --> 14:11.080
Sanniang.

14:20.120 --> 14:21.000
We're here.

14:21.320 --> 14:22.480
Finally.

14:22.759 --> 14:23.519
Long time no see.

14:23.519 --> 14:24.080
Easy.

14:25.639 --> 14:26.960
- Miss Xie.
- Miss Xie.

14:26.960 --> 14:27.759
Greetings, ladies.

14:28.080 --> 14:29.080
I don't deserve such courtesy.

14:29.279 --> 14:30.320
I said I didn't want to come,

14:30.320 --> 14:31.960
but they feared I'd be lonely
in the northwest

14:31.960 --> 14:32.879
and insisted I join.

14:34.039 --> 14:35.039
Where is Madam Mo?

14:35.039 --> 14:35.759
She?

14:35.759 --> 14:37.000
She's worried about General Mo.

14:37.000 --> 14:39.159
She insisted on traveling with the men.

14:41.080 --> 14:42.000
Here they come.

14:42.000 --> 14:42.720
Here they come.

14:46.840 --> 14:47.440
Here they come.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.039
Here they come.

14:53.240 --> 14:56.360
(Second Young Lady Wang)

15:08.000 --> 15:08.799
Sister.

15:09.679 --> 15:10.799
It's been so long.

15:11.000 --> 15:12.000
I trust you've been well.

15:28.759 --> 15:30.200
I brought some things from Ganlin,

15:30.200 --> 15:31.360
goji berries and red astragalus.

15:31.440 --> 15:33.159
They all grew in your soil.

15:33.759 --> 15:35.240
How have you been?

15:35.759 --> 15:36.399
Good.

15:38.000 --> 15:38.720
Tingyun,

15:39.399 --> 15:40.759
I have something to ask you.

15:41.639 --> 15:43.320
Please go ahead.

15:43.960 --> 15:44.919
Do you know

15:44.919 --> 15:46.399
if the candidate
for Imperial Salt Censor

15:46.399 --> 15:47.559
has been decided?

15:49.200 --> 15:50.879
I'm not sure about that.

15:51.720 --> 15:53.320
The post of Imperial Salt Censor

15:53.320 --> 15:54.360
carries great weight.

15:55.440 --> 15:57.360
We both know the impact
of the new salt law

15:57.559 --> 15:58.960
on the northwest.

15:59.840 --> 16:00.759
But the court

16:00.960 --> 16:02.399
has already decided to implement it.

16:02.519 --> 16:03.679
So be it.

16:04.360 --> 16:05.840
But if the right person is chosen,

16:06.279 --> 16:07.720
they could share Zhao Ling's burden

16:08.159 --> 16:09.879
and leave a lifeline for the northwest.

16:10.159 --> 16:10.919
For you,

16:10.919 --> 16:11.840
for Zhao Ling,

16:11.840 --> 16:12.639
for the northwest,

16:12.799 --> 16:13.919
it would be for the best.

16:16.759 --> 16:18.120
Do you have someone

16:18.120 --> 16:19.559
in mind?

16:19.799 --> 16:21.679
I do have a suitable candidate

16:22.279 --> 16:23.360
named Shen Congsi.

16:24.360 --> 16:25.759
I've learned through my inquiries

16:25.879 --> 16:27.919
that he is your sister-in-law's
elder brother.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.559
He has no factional ties

16:29.559 --> 16:30.480
and conducts himself fairly.

16:30.759 --> 16:31.919
Most importantly,

16:34.600 --> 16:36.639
his Memorial on Salt and Grain
for the Nine Border Garrisons

16:36.840 --> 16:38.200
is remarkably thorough.

16:38.960 --> 16:40.159
The grain-for-salt system

16:40.159 --> 16:41.480
has been in place for over a century.

16:41.600 --> 16:43.440
Merchants transport grain
to the frontier

16:43.759 --> 16:44.919
in exchange for salt permits.

16:45.279 --> 16:46.960
Border granaries
have thus been well stocked.

16:47.320 --> 16:48.759
If we abruptly switch
to silver payments,

16:48.840 --> 16:51.200
allowing merchants to pay in silver
instead of grain,

16:51.600 --> 16:53.039
then the grain transport
to the northwest

16:53.039 --> 16:54.240
will inevitably decline.

16:54.519 --> 16:56.159
If the border is ever in crisis,

16:56.159 --> 16:57.440
and the granaries are empty,

16:57.639 --> 16:59.480
we may regret it too late.

17:04.319 --> 17:05.880
(Submitted by Record Keeper Shen Congsi)
He understands border affairs.

17:06.359 --> 17:07.640
He is a moderate.

17:08.079 --> 17:09.480
He is the best choice.

17:18.039 --> 17:18.920
I understand.

17:20.560 --> 17:23.880
(Memorial on Salt and Grain
for the Nine Border Garrisons)

17:26.079 --> 17:27.480
It's not resentment.

17:27.960 --> 17:28.720
It's just that

17:28.839 --> 17:30.240
after Yucheng passed,

17:30.720 --> 17:31.559
I haven't had a proper talk

17:31.559 --> 17:32.839
with Mr. Zhao.

17:34.200 --> 17:35.000
Honestly,

17:35.440 --> 17:37.279
I got over that anger a long time ago.

17:38.079 --> 17:39.559
I just feel

17:39.880 --> 17:40.960
I miss him

17:41.240 --> 17:42.279
and I'm a little scared of him.

17:45.480 --> 17:46.480
It's like

17:46.759 --> 17:47.839
when I look at my father.

17:48.359 --> 17:49.839
I want to act all sweet with him,

17:50.079 --> 17:51.480
but he's always busy,

17:51.720 --> 17:52.880
and he's always scolding me.

17:53.200 --> 17:54.720
So I don't want to talk to him.

17:55.640 --> 17:56.880
I don't act sweet.

17:57.759 --> 17:58.680
I'm too old

17:58.680 --> 17:59.480
for that.

18:01.200 --> 18:02.839
You may have grown taller,

18:03.279 --> 18:04.160
but your personality

18:04.440 --> 18:05.960
is still the same
as when you were little.

18:13.119 --> 18:13.680
Oh, right.

18:13.680 --> 18:14.079
I...

18:14.079 --> 18:14.960
What is it?

18:20.839 --> 18:22.720
I spent three whole nights making this.

18:23.000 --> 18:24.359
The bowstring is soaked roe deer sinew.

18:24.359 --> 18:25.240
It won't break.

18:26.160 --> 18:27.359
It may not look very pretty,

18:27.359 --> 18:27.799
but

18:28.119 --> 18:29.559
it's definitely better
than what the armory gives you.

18:34.599 --> 18:35.039
I...

18:35.039 --> 18:35.960
I'll get going.

18:47.160 --> 18:47.880
Idiot.

18:49.920 --> 18:51.480
How could you give this to a girl?

19:00.359 --> 19:01.119
Sanniang.

19:02.319 --> 19:03.720
Please run an errand for me.

19:03.799 --> 19:05.200
Tell my sister-in-law

19:06.640 --> 19:07.839
to meet me at the Xie's shop

19:08.599 --> 19:09.880
at nine tomorrow morning.

19:09.880 --> 19:10.519
Alright.

19:10.519 --> 19:11.200
Got it.

19:17.200 --> 19:18.160
Ninth Young Lady.

19:18.680 --> 19:20.240
In the Fu family's household matters,

19:20.720 --> 19:22.200
as a daughter-in-law,

19:22.759 --> 19:24.599
I truly cannot overrule the elders.

19:26.559 --> 19:27.720
Rest assured.

19:28.759 --> 19:30.000
Today's invitation

19:30.160 --> 19:31.519
is for public matters, not private ones.

19:35.400 --> 19:36.880
I heard that your elder brother

19:37.920 --> 19:40.079
is interested
in the Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor post.

19:44.839 --> 19:46.319
His Majesty is pushing forward
with the salt reform.

19:46.480 --> 19:47.519
This position

19:47.519 --> 19:48.480
is of critical importance.

19:49.599 --> 19:51.000
We have searched for a long time

19:51.319 --> 19:52.759
and found your brother

19:52.759 --> 19:53.680
to be the most suitable.

19:53.759 --> 19:54.799
We intend to recommend him.

19:55.240 --> 19:56.039
Today,

19:56.039 --> 19:57.759
I came to share this with you.

20:04.279 --> 20:06.079
Your brother is deeply learned.

20:06.599 --> 20:07.599
What is even rarer

20:07.599 --> 20:08.920
is that he understands
practical affairs,

20:09.119 --> 20:10.359
knows the way of governing,

20:10.480 --> 20:12.000
and understands the people's hardships.

20:16.880 --> 20:17.880
To be honest, I know

20:19.160 --> 20:20.480
that the one who truly understands

20:20.920 --> 20:22.200
practical affairs,

20:22.640 --> 20:23.720
besides your brother, is you.

20:25.279 --> 20:26.319
If you are willing,

20:26.640 --> 20:28.119
I can put the shops in the capital

20:28.119 --> 20:29.440
under your management

20:30.400 --> 20:31.720
to help support the household.

20:32.480 --> 20:33.839
You don't have to do this.

20:39.480 --> 20:40.599
Thank you

20:41.079 --> 20:42.279
for managing the Fu household

20:42.279 --> 20:43.400
and caring for Mother

20:43.920 --> 20:44.920
all these years.

20:46.960 --> 20:47.839
Please rise.

20:50.359 --> 20:51.160
You truly put me

20:51.839 --> 20:53.160
in a difficult position.

20:56.160 --> 20:57.680
I only wish to do a little more

21:00.440 --> 21:01.839
for Mother.

21:08.119 --> 21:09.960
When I was pushed
to the brink back then,

21:11.079 --> 21:13.160
Mr. Zhao reached out
and pulled me through.

21:13.440 --> 21:15.880
Our bond was born out of hardship.

21:17.519 --> 21:19.720
He is no shallow man who chases beauty,

21:20.079 --> 21:22.240
and I am no woman
who abandoned her family.

21:24.240 --> 21:25.880
If there is any fault,

21:27.000 --> 21:29.240
it's that two wounded souls

21:30.400 --> 21:32.240
awkwardly clung
to each other for comfort.

21:40.519 --> 21:41.079
Alright.

21:42.160 --> 21:43.440
I agree.

21:43.720 --> 21:44.480
Have a seat.

21:53.119 --> 21:53.920
Don't worry.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.480
I will write

21:55.480 --> 21:56.839
to your brother right away

21:56.839 --> 21:58.119
and ask him to return to the capital.

21:58.680 --> 22:00.000
When you reunite,

22:00.480 --> 22:01.400
things

22:01.480 --> 22:02.960
will be better

22:03.359 --> 22:04.480
for you and Mother.

22:05.480 --> 22:06.559
Thank you.

22:15.079 --> 22:15.759
Father.

22:17.000 --> 22:18.440
About the Imperial Salt Censor post,

22:18.440 --> 22:19.480
what do they intend to do?

22:20.839 --> 22:22.799
Tingyun

22:23.000 --> 22:24.839
to recommend talent,
regardless of family ties.

22:25.240 --> 22:25.839
She...

22:25.920 --> 22:26.400
Good.

22:26.839 --> 22:27.240
Father...

22:27.240 --> 22:28.119
Excellent.

22:28.119 --> 22:28.559
No.

22:28.839 --> 22:30.319
Tingyun means for me to...

22:30.319 --> 22:31.759
Look how sharp that Zhao Ling is.

22:31.759 --> 22:34.440
A little guidance and he knows
how to show such respect.

22:34.799 --> 22:36.319
Now that is a worthy son-in-law.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.359
For this vacancy,

22:37.359 --> 22:38.880
I have waited seven years.

22:39.559 --> 22:41.440
His devotion is truly moving!

22:42.519 --> 22:44.880
So many people seeking favors,
you've been entertaining nonstop.

22:45.079 --> 22:46.240
Mr. Zhao, have some tea

22:46.240 --> 22:47.039
to sober up.

22:51.559 --> 22:53.960
The other day,
Madam Wang mentioned to me

22:54.440 --> 22:56.119
the candidate for Imperial Salt Censor.

23:10.359 --> 23:11.480
Who did she recommend?

23:12.519 --> 23:13.920
It's Shen Congsi,

23:15.559 --> 23:17.079
my sister-in-law's elder brother.

23:18.160 --> 23:19.759
He has no factional ties,

23:20.039 --> 23:21.119
and is the fairest in his judgments.

23:21.200 --> 23:22.440
He also understands

23:22.880 --> 23:24.480
the vital importance
of balancing salt and grain.

23:25.240 --> 23:26.640
He even wrote

23:26.839 --> 23:28.279
the Memorial on Salt and Grain
for the Nine Border Garrisons.

23:28.720 --> 23:30.640
each word striking at the core
of the salt reform.

23:36.200 --> 23:37.599
Recommending talent
without avoiding family ties

23:39.000 --> 23:41.200
is not a problem, given your relation.

23:42.400 --> 23:43.599
But this man,

23:44.039 --> 23:45.680
during the metropolitan exam that year,

23:46.519 --> 23:47.559
was the top scholar.

23:48.960 --> 23:50.359
Yet in the palace exam,

23:50.480 --> 23:51.839
he offended the Emperor

23:53.119 --> 23:54.920
and only placed in the third tier.

23:55.799 --> 23:56.960
He finished as a same-rank scholar.

24:04.319 --> 24:05.720
I made some inquiries.

24:06.640 --> 24:08.279
It was because of this editorial

24:09.079 --> 24:10.279
that he drew criticism.

24:21.720 --> 24:24.240
(Juheng News Agency)
Those who leave their mark in history

24:24.480 --> 24:26.440
either rely on noble birth,

24:26.799 --> 24:28.519
or striking appearance,

24:28.720 --> 24:30.799
or exceptional talent,

24:31.960 --> 24:34.400
or extraordinary fortune.

24:35.279 --> 24:37.599
Heaven grants countless paths to men.

24:38.200 --> 24:39.519
Wealthy and noble households,

24:39.599 --> 24:40.960
splendid halls and golden horses,

24:40.960 --> 24:42.279
all are open roads.

24:42.640 --> 24:43.319
Yet

24:43.319 --> 24:45.559
having received such favor from heaven
and gained these shortcuts,

24:45.880 --> 24:47.839
if one still cannot open new frontiers

24:47.839 --> 24:49.200
and build lasting achievements,

24:49.599 --> 24:51.119
what face does one have

24:52.160 --> 24:54.039
to speak of fairness?

24:54.880 --> 24:56.160
Such arrogance.

24:57.400 --> 24:58.839
Now I understand

24:59.160 --> 25:00.799
that he didn't offend the Emperor,

25:01.599 --> 25:02.720
but someone else.

25:04.079 --> 25:05.599
You cannot overlook the northwest

25:07.480 --> 25:08.680
and rush ahead blindly.

25:19.079 --> 25:20.799
The salt reform is a monumental task.

25:21.839 --> 25:23.400
Every move I make

25:24.440 --> 25:26.200
will be interpreted in many ways.

25:41.599 --> 25:43.000
Let me be frank with you.

25:46.000 --> 25:47.160
His Majesty's wish

25:48.039 --> 25:49.640
is to place a radical

25:51.720 --> 25:53.319
in this position.

25:56.480 --> 25:57.880
I've already put

25:58.799 --> 26:00.240
my candidate on the list.

26:03.039 --> 26:03.920
As for you,

26:06.640 --> 26:07.960
stop worrying about this.

26:09.160 --> 26:10.480
That would be best for both of us.

26:38.640 --> 26:40.400
It seems we can't go through

26:41.599 --> 26:43.039
Mr. Zhao.

26:43.799 --> 26:45.119
What he said

26:46.799 --> 26:48.000
is not without reason.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.640
But Shen Congsi

26:51.920 --> 26:53.880
is truly the most suitable candidate.

26:55.839 --> 26:57.599
He sees the consequences
of the salt reform

26:58.079 --> 26:59.400
and knows how to act with restraint.

26:59.799 --> 27:00.960
It would also serve as a buffer

27:01.039 --> 27:02.359
for Commander Wang.

27:03.599 --> 27:04.720
In any case,

27:05.240 --> 27:07.039
the northwest is Mr. Zhao's foundation.

27:07.519 --> 27:08.880
But just now,

27:09.880 --> 27:11.400
he already turned you down.

27:12.599 --> 27:14.160
I will find another way.

27:16.799 --> 27:18.160
With the salt reform imminent,

27:19.920 --> 27:21.160
someone must

27:21.559 --> 27:23.519
speak for the northwest garrisons.

27:25.279 --> 27:26.559
Go! Quick, run!

27:26.559 --> 27:27.920
Quick, overtake it!

27:28.240 --> 27:29.160
Run!

27:29.160 --> 27:29.920
Look!

27:30.359 --> 27:31.400
Look at that one!

27:31.640 --> 27:32.960
It's so fast!

27:33.039 --> 27:34.240
Run!

27:34.720 --> 27:35.880
Wanyi, look at that one!

27:36.400 --> 27:37.599
So cute.

27:37.839 --> 27:39.680
Ladies, please add some prizes

27:39.680 --> 27:40.559
to make it more fun.

27:40.960 --> 27:42.960
Faster!

27:43.319 --> 27:44.319
Run!

27:52.960 --> 27:53.720
Mozhan.

28:00.960 --> 28:01.680
Young Madam Yu,

28:01.680 --> 28:03.920
you're even willing to part
with such a large gilded item.

28:04.559 --> 28:05.680
It's no use just sitting around.

28:06.000 --> 28:07.359
Better to add it as a prize

28:07.799 --> 28:08.880
so that everyone

28:08.960 --> 28:10.359
can enjoy themselves more.

28:11.240 --> 28:13.039
Ladies, please draw your lots.

28:14.519 --> 28:16.599
Then I'll take the red one
for good luck.

28:16.599 --> 28:17.680
A good omen.

28:32.599 --> 28:33.240
Ready!

28:33.599 --> 28:35.119
Go!

28:35.240 --> 28:36.640
Go, run!

28:36.759 --> 28:38.000
Yellow, run!

28:38.000 --> 28:39.279
Faster!

28:39.279 --> 28:39.920
- Run!
- Come on!

28:39.920 --> 28:40.680
Red!

28:40.880 --> 28:41.839
Go!

28:41.839 --> 28:42.400
Run!

28:43.000 --> 28:43.960
This way.

28:43.960 --> 28:44.720
Your rabbit!

28:45.680 --> 28:47.079
Red is so fast!

28:47.079 --> 28:48.440
Faster!

28:48.640 --> 28:49.400
Go!

28:49.400 --> 28:50.400
Go forward!

28:50.640 --> 28:51.920
Go forward!

28:52.039 --> 28:53.079
Go!

28:54.200 --> 28:54.839
Quick!

28:54.839 --> 28:55.240
Go!

28:55.240 --> 28:56.200
Hurry!

28:56.960 --> 28:58.240
Yes, just like that!

28:58.640 --> 29:00.680
Go, faster!

29:01.119 --> 29:02.079
Hurry!

29:02.079 --> 29:03.160
Don't stop!

29:03.160 --> 29:04.000
What's going on?

29:04.000 --> 29:04.799
Why isn't it running?

29:04.799 --> 29:05.880
Come on, Red!

29:05.880 --> 29:07.680
Madam Wei, your rabbit is too fast!

29:07.680 --> 29:08.279
Mine!

29:08.279 --> 29:09.440
Almost there!

29:09.920 --> 29:10.440
Almost there!

29:10.440 --> 29:11.319
Your rabbit!

29:11.319 --> 29:12.400
Your rabbit!

29:13.440 --> 29:14.200
I win!

29:14.200 --> 29:15.559
I win!

29:16.559 --> 29:17.359
I win!

29:18.160 --> 29:18.960
I told you!

29:18.960 --> 29:19.920
Red is a lucky color!

29:19.920 --> 29:20.240
Yes!

29:20.240 --> 29:22.200
Congratulations, Madam Wei,
on taking the lead!

29:22.200 --> 29:23.400
Your rabbit

29:23.400 --> 29:24.759
runs faster than a horse.

29:24.759 --> 29:25.839
Indeed.

29:25.839 --> 29:26.519
Wanyi,

29:26.519 --> 29:28.000
next time you must host us

29:28.000 --> 29:28.960
so we can all

29:28.960 --> 29:30.319
share in your good fortune.

29:30.440 --> 29:31.359
Don't worry,

29:31.359 --> 29:33.279
you're all invited to my place

29:33.279 --> 29:33.839
for drinks.

29:33.839 --> 29:34.519
Great!

29:35.039 --> 29:36.079
Let's go take a look.

29:36.079 --> 29:36.599
Let's go.

29:37.480 --> 29:39.079
Good rabbit!

29:47.079 --> 29:48.480
You really went out of your way.

29:48.759 --> 29:50.039
I remember how you usually

29:50.119 --> 29:51.920
can't stand these

29:52.039 --> 29:53.400
cats and rabbits.

29:54.000 --> 29:55.000
But today,

29:55.000 --> 29:56.720
you went to all this trouble

29:56.720 --> 29:57.759
just to cheer me up.

29:58.079 --> 29:59.960
Is there something you want from me?

30:00.759 --> 30:01.920
I wouldn't call it asking,

30:02.160 --> 30:03.680
but adding a name
to the recommendation list

30:04.000 --> 30:05.279
should be easy

30:05.279 --> 30:06.400
for you.

30:07.359 --> 30:09.079
And it has nothing to do
with the prize just now.

30:10.039 --> 30:11.680
You sure know how to talk.

30:12.640 --> 30:13.640
Thank you, Wanyi.

30:17.720 --> 30:20.720
(Tanshui Temple)

30:38.640 --> 30:39.400
You're here.

30:40.720 --> 30:41.759
I arrived in the capital days ago.

30:41.759 --> 30:42.759
I should have come to see you sooner.

30:42.759 --> 30:44.880
Please forgive my late visit.

30:45.720 --> 30:46.400
Please sit.

30:49.799 --> 30:52.160
I was just worried
I had no one to play weiqi with.

30:52.240 --> 30:52.680
Come.

30:52.799 --> 30:53.599
Let's have a game.

30:59.200 --> 31:00.759
It's been years.

31:01.039 --> 31:03.200
Your playing has grown
much more composed.

31:03.599 --> 31:05.119
How could I dare

31:05.200 --> 31:06.240
to be rash before you?

31:07.640 --> 31:08.880
Seeing you now,

31:08.880 --> 31:10.279
so detached and beyond worldly concerns,

31:10.400 --> 31:11.680
I feel that all things

31:11.680 --> 31:12.960
can be met with calm.

31:19.079 --> 31:20.880
The world is like a board.

31:21.599 --> 31:23.480
You may speak freely, Miss Xie.

31:27.279 --> 31:29.359
Master, when you resigned
and retreated to the mountains,

31:29.599 --> 31:31.079
was it truly
only to withdraw from the world?

31:37.000 --> 31:38.920
The incense at Tanshui Temple

31:39.920 --> 31:41.440
is hardly more peaceful

31:41.440 --> 31:42.440
than the Six Ministries.

31:47.880 --> 31:49.160
You're really perceptive.

31:49.160 --> 31:51.279
Every day, many people come before me,

31:51.279 --> 31:52.559
begging me to save the masses.

31:53.480 --> 31:54.640
I just never expected

31:54.759 --> 31:56.160
that you would come today as well.

31:58.799 --> 31:59.960
Tell me.

32:00.039 --> 32:01.960
What brings you here today?

32:05.920 --> 32:07.440
(Yu Residence)

32:07.440 --> 32:09.400
Do you know who's on the list

32:10.200 --> 32:11.519
submitted by the Ministry of Personnel?

32:11.880 --> 32:13.079
Isn't my husband's name

32:13.200 --> 32:14.319
on it?

32:14.319 --> 32:15.480
Jingxiu is on it.

32:16.680 --> 32:18.000
But so is Shen Congsi.

32:18.440 --> 32:20.799
He is the elder brother
of Fu Tingyun's sister-in-law.

32:21.240 --> 32:23.240
What I want
is not just Jingxiu's name on the list,

32:23.599 --> 32:25.079
but only Jingxiu's name.

32:25.440 --> 32:26.680
I heard that Fu Tingyun

32:26.680 --> 32:28.440
has sought out Master Zhao
of Tanshui Temple.

32:29.119 --> 32:30.960
He was the Emperor's former tutor.

32:32.640 --> 32:33.319
And you?

32:37.279 --> 32:39.319
Shen Congsi is talented,

32:40.000 --> 32:41.799
but his foundation is shallow.

32:42.119 --> 32:43.480
With Jingxiu's qualifications,

32:43.480 --> 32:44.720
he may not necessarily lose.

32:46.640 --> 32:48.079
If you want to stand firm,

32:48.359 --> 32:50.359
mere friendships among women
are not enough.

32:51.839 --> 32:54.079
There is still much for you to learn.

32:54.480 --> 32:55.519
I understand, Mother.

32:59.839 --> 33:00.559
Go.

33:09.839 --> 33:11.359
Since you accepted the rabbit hutch,

33:11.599 --> 33:12.720
and gave me your word,

33:13.240 --> 33:15.160
how could you add someone else
to the list?

33:15.880 --> 33:17.200
Have you forgotten?

33:17.400 --> 33:18.559
That rabbit hutch

33:18.559 --> 33:21.000
was the prize I won from you
in the rabbit race.

33:21.440 --> 33:22.960
Everyone saw it.

33:23.599 --> 33:24.759
I am someone

33:24.759 --> 33:26.519
who speaks plainly.

33:26.519 --> 33:28.319
If you need me to do something,

33:28.319 --> 33:29.480
you should have

33:29.599 --> 33:31.079
spoken more directly.

33:32.200 --> 33:32.720
You...

33:34.039 --> 33:34.839
You cannot

33:34.839 --> 33:36.039
hold yourself so high

33:36.039 --> 33:37.519
and still expect me to protect you.

33:37.519 --> 33:39.359
Such a good deal
doesn't exist in this world.

33:40.200 --> 33:41.160
When you ask a favor,

33:41.160 --> 33:42.680
you should act like it.

33:46.839 --> 33:47.680
All these years,

33:48.559 --> 33:50.480
have you ever truly considered me
a friend?

33:52.839 --> 33:53.839
Friendships

33:53.839 --> 33:55.200
vary in depth.

33:55.759 --> 33:57.200
There are drinking companions,

33:57.279 --> 33:58.640
strategic allies,

33:58.640 --> 34:00.119
and life-or-death bonds.

34:00.440 --> 34:01.759
Tell me, Young Madam Yu,

34:02.039 --> 34:04.039
which kind do you want to be?

34:05.200 --> 34:07.359
If you wish to be my confidant,

34:07.519 --> 34:09.880
what happened to the last person

34:10.000 --> 34:11.639
who trusted you with their heart?

34:11.800 --> 34:12.880
And besides,

34:13.320 --> 34:14.719
the future

34:14.719 --> 34:16.000
is never clear.

34:16.360 --> 34:18.480
For now, it may be a fair contest,

34:18.480 --> 34:19.599
but in the end,

34:19.599 --> 34:21.000
your husband might just be the winner.

34:33.159 --> 34:35.679
I acquired a fine piece
of malachite a few days ago.

34:36.039 --> 34:37.800
I ground it into pigment.

34:38.039 --> 34:39.199
Remembering your niece's painting

34:39.199 --> 34:41.079
at the first-year banquet,

34:41.480 --> 34:42.960
I thought this color

34:43.119 --> 34:44.239
might add

34:44.239 --> 34:45.360
a touch of grace to her work.

34:45.679 --> 34:47.280
She has done nothing
to deserve such a gift.

34:47.480 --> 34:49.000
Your kindness, Young Madam,

34:49.159 --> 34:50.519
is far too generous.

34:54.239 --> 34:55.039
You are

34:55.039 --> 34:56.199
blessed.

34:56.599 --> 34:58.079
It is only right
that others think highly of you.

34:58.159 --> 34:59.280
In the past few days,

34:59.280 --> 35:00.599
I have taken it upon myself to look

35:00.960 --> 35:03.039
and found an excellent match for her.

35:05.719 --> 35:06.639
The Wei family.

35:09.440 --> 35:11.280
Surely you are joking, Young Madam.

35:11.559 --> 35:13.039
Though
I have not been in the capital long,

35:13.199 --> 35:14.880
I do know that the Wei family

35:15.239 --> 35:16.400
answers to the Tian family.

35:24.840 --> 35:26.280
Look at you, so startled.

35:27.639 --> 35:29.800
Of course, she can't be the wife.

35:30.159 --> 35:31.320
However,

35:31.760 --> 35:32.639
taking her

35:33.280 --> 35:34.400
as a concubine

35:34.920 --> 35:36.480
would save you a lot of trouble.

35:36.800 --> 35:37.960
A concubine?

35:40.519 --> 35:42.760
By rights, since you have spoken,

35:43.000 --> 35:44.320
I should agree.

35:44.760 --> 35:46.320
But my niece,

35:46.599 --> 35:48.400
since childhood, has mastered

35:48.400 --> 35:49.639
the arts of a gentlewoman.

35:50.159 --> 35:52.119
I have cherished her like a treasure.

35:52.480 --> 35:55.159
I cannot bear to see her
become a concubine

35:56.639 --> 35:58.159
with no standing.

36:00.239 --> 36:01.760
Lord Wei Donglin

36:02.079 --> 36:03.599
is the Left Vice Minister
of the Ministry of Personnel.

36:04.119 --> 36:05.880
He is in charge of recommending talent.

36:06.760 --> 36:07.840
No matter who

36:07.840 --> 36:10.039
ends up with the post
of Imperial Salt Censor,

36:10.039 --> 36:12.039
they will be grateful
for his recommendation.

36:13.039 --> 36:14.119
If you want

36:14.119 --> 36:15.760
to have a voice in the future,

36:16.320 --> 36:17.599
you must be willing to give.

36:20.800 --> 36:21.599
But

36:22.079 --> 36:23.239
why would such a good thing

36:23.239 --> 36:24.920
fall on our family?

36:25.960 --> 36:28.280
You high-born families
have all the news.

36:28.559 --> 36:30.119
But what reaches our ears

36:30.599 --> 36:31.960
may not be the full story.

36:34.000 --> 36:35.599
Could it be, Young Madam,

36:36.239 --> 36:38.000
that you are telling us
only half the truth

36:38.119 --> 36:39.880
and using us as your pawns?

36:48.480 --> 36:50.719
I do not have
my mother-in-law's scheming mind.

36:51.400 --> 36:52.400
Rest assured.

36:52.920 --> 36:53.719
This time,

36:53.920 --> 36:55.119
what you can find out

36:55.320 --> 36:56.440
and what you cannot,

36:57.079 --> 36:58.599
I will lay it all out for you.

37:08.119 --> 37:09.639
If you do this, Young Madam,

37:09.880 --> 37:11.599
are you not afraid
of offending Madam Wei?

37:13.400 --> 37:15.000
When she went back on her word,

37:15.159 --> 37:16.440
did she consider peace?

37:18.760 --> 37:20.719
What matters
is Jingxiu's official position.

37:21.880 --> 37:24.239
As long as Miss Wu
can whisper in his ear,

37:25.360 --> 37:27.480
Wei Donglin will be under our control.

37:30.199 --> 37:32.199
It all depends on the skills
of the aunt and niece.

37:33.599 --> 37:34.840
Let us hope they are up to it.

37:35.200 --> 37:36.519
(Tanshui Temple)

37:36.519 --> 37:37.800
Old Madam Wei, please wait.

37:38.920 --> 37:40.119
Who are you?

37:40.199 --> 37:41.840
Madam Wu of Anzhou.

37:43.039 --> 37:44.280
Madam Wu.

37:44.440 --> 37:46.400
I have long wished to pay you a visit,

37:46.480 --> 37:48.519
but I never found the right occasion.

37:48.800 --> 37:49.840
I never expected

37:49.840 --> 37:51.199
that by coming here to pray,

37:51.280 --> 37:53.360
I would be fortunate enough to meet you.

37:55.320 --> 37:56.400
May I ask, Madam Wu,

37:56.400 --> 37:57.679
what brings you to me?

37:57.679 --> 37:58.840
To be honest,

37:58.960 --> 38:01.119
it's about my dear niece.

38:06.599 --> 38:08.880
A woman's marriage
is of the utmost importance.

38:09.199 --> 38:10.679
But my niece and I

38:10.679 --> 38:12.039
are new to the capital.

38:12.159 --> 38:13.519
We have no footing here.

38:14.239 --> 38:14.960
I humbly ask you

38:15.280 --> 38:17.320
to make the decision for her.

38:20.119 --> 38:20.880
Madam,

38:21.079 --> 38:22.519
women of Anzhou

38:22.679 --> 38:24.239
are known to bring good fortune
to their families.

38:28.719 --> 38:29.880
My niece here

38:29.880 --> 38:31.480
may appear delicate,

38:32.079 --> 38:33.920
but she has

38:33.920 --> 38:35.519
a fine figure for bearing children.

38:40.559 --> 38:41.679
Truly,

38:41.679 --> 38:43.440
she's an excellent choice.

38:43.440 --> 38:44.519
Of course.

38:46.000 --> 38:48.079
Look at you, you useless son.

38:49.119 --> 38:50.760
(Wei Donglin, Left Vice Minister)
What's wrong with wanting a grandson?

38:51.039 --> 38:53.239
Which woman in her prime

38:53.239 --> 38:54.840
would stop having children

38:54.840 --> 38:56.480
after just one daughter?

38:56.559 --> 38:57.440
Mother,

38:57.440 --> 38:58.119
keep your voice down.

38:58.119 --> 38:59.280
Don't let Wanyi hear.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.519
Wanyi, huh?

39:00.519 --> 39:01.960
You only ever look to Wanyi.

39:01.960 --> 39:03.400
Am I even your mother?

39:04.599 --> 39:05.360
Tell me,

39:05.679 --> 39:07.880
it's one thing
that you used to be afraid of her.

39:08.280 --> 39:10.960
But now Grand Secretary Tian
is about to retire.

39:11.119 --> 39:12.920
You're a third-rank official,

39:13.199 --> 39:14.519
and you're still afraid of her?

39:18.920 --> 39:19.880
My son,

39:20.440 --> 39:22.360
you have served others for years.

39:22.360 --> 39:23.440
Now

39:23.599 --> 39:25.000
it's time for others

39:25.000 --> 39:27.159
to serve you.

39:32.360 --> 39:33.679
It's so hot today,

39:33.880 --> 39:36.000
and you still have to wear this.

39:36.320 --> 39:37.199
Hurry up.

39:37.519 --> 39:39.159
If we keep Old Madam Wei
waiting too long,

39:39.239 --> 39:40.920
my aunt will surely punish us.

39:43.079 --> 39:44.079
A concubine?

39:45.559 --> 39:46.679
My niece here,

39:46.800 --> 39:48.639
I raised her with care
since she was little

39:48.639 --> 39:50.119
and treasured her dearly.

39:52.159 --> 39:52.880
It's

39:52.880 --> 39:54.280
only temporary.

39:54.280 --> 39:56.360
Once she bears a son,

39:56.639 --> 39:58.440
she must be taken into the Wei family.

39:58.840 --> 40:00.280
Then your niece,

40:00.280 --> 40:01.400
with a son to her name,

40:02.000 --> 40:03.280
will have nothing to regret.

40:03.440 --> 40:04.960
That may be so,

40:04.960 --> 40:06.000
but word gets around.

40:06.000 --> 40:07.400
It won't look good.

40:10.719 --> 40:11.800
Madam Wu,

40:11.800 --> 40:13.480
are you joking with me?

40:13.880 --> 40:15.679
You managed to get through

40:15.679 --> 40:16.840
the willow-shooting gathering.

40:17.360 --> 40:18.519
Surely you're not going

40:18.760 --> 40:20.320
to fuss over this?

40:20.840 --> 40:23.159
If my niece truly bears a son,

40:23.440 --> 40:25.039
she must be taken into the Wei family.

40:27.079 --> 40:29.599
Since we've come this far in our talk,

40:29.599 --> 40:30.760
there's no time to waste.

40:31.159 --> 40:32.840
Tomorrow, after my son leaves court,

40:33.000 --> 40:34.360
I will have him come over.

40:34.960 --> 40:35.960
Leave this matter

40:35.960 --> 40:37.159
to me.

40:37.519 --> 40:39.320
I will see it through.

40:41.239 --> 40:43.079
They only see me as a vessel

40:43.800 --> 40:45.320
for bearing children.

40:46.760 --> 40:48.159
My Lady, you are delicate.

40:48.639 --> 40:50.840
How could you endure such mistreatment?

40:52.119 --> 40:53.679
If this were the past,

40:54.480 --> 40:55.480
I would have accepted it.

40:57.719 --> 40:58.760
But now,

40:59.960 --> 41:01.599
I must find a way out.

41:05.800 --> 41:08.200
(Next Episode)

41:08.800 --> 41:10.159
I'd like to see,

41:10.280 --> 41:11.880
without this pretty face of yours,

41:12.039 --> 41:14.239
how you'll manage to seduce
another woman's husband.

41:14.559 --> 41:16.360
You truly are a born wretch.

41:16.760 --> 41:18.519
You came from humble origins.

41:18.800 --> 41:19.840
Everything you have today

41:20.000 --> 41:22.239
came through shady means.

41:22.599 --> 41:24.039
(Plaintiff: Li)
I, Li, an old servant,

41:24.039 --> 41:26.280
hereby accuse Ninth Young Lady Fu.

41:26.480 --> 41:27.840
The two of them eloped,

41:27.840 --> 41:31.039
causing Old Madam Fu's death!

41:31.320 --> 41:33.679
You can't even manage
your own household affairs.

41:33.679 --> 41:35.039
What qualifies you

41:35.039 --> 41:36.840
to serve as Assistant Censor-in-Chief?

41:37.000 --> 41:39.039
I beg Your Majesty to reconsider

41:39.360 --> 41:40.599
and appoint a more worthy candidate

41:40.599 --> 41:41.920
to oversee the reforms.

41:55.200 --> 41:59.520
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

42:03.120 --> 42:07.480
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

42:09.600 --> 42:14.240
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

42:14.480 --> 42:17.280
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

42:18.440 --> 42:23.080
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

42:26.280 --> 42:33.120
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

42:34.000 --> 42:40.520
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

42:41.480 --> 42:44.920
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:45.440 --> 42:49.640
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:49.920 --> 42:55.600
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

43:07.720 --> 43:11.600
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

43:15.520 --> 43:19.520
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

43:21.240 --> 43:25.920
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

43:26.240 --> 43:28.920
♪Kept close within my heart♪

43:30.000 --> 43:34.840
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

43:38.360 --> 43:45.280
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

43:46.160 --> 43:52.640
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

43:53.520 --> 43:57.040
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:57.480 --> 44:01.840
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

44:02.040 --> 44:07.760
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
